(2229851, 306836, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition, great concept, needs to have better focus on the dog''s head. Looks like the dog moved during the shot since the near foreground is focused and the background tie is focused. The object (ruler?) under the dog''s chin is a distraction.</td>', 'Good composition, great concept, needs to have better focus on the dog''s head. Looks like the dog moved during the shot since the near foreground is focused and the background tie is focused. The object (ruler?) under the dog''s chin is a distraction.', '2006-03-15 09:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
