(2229875, 306492, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sepia works well. Well focused. You captured your subject in a studious pose.<br/> <br/>The image lacks a full tonal range. Try this... set a black point at the darkest spot in the composition and you may find the image will maintain its current tonality but will have much better contrast and will stand more. It is a little "flat" as it is currently. In photography there is a constant battle between tonality that shows nice gradations from one tone to another and contrast which washes out tones. It is hard to find the happy medium.</td>', 'Nice composition and sepia works well. Well focused. You captured your subject in a studious pose. The image lacks a full tonal range. Try this... set a black point at the darkest spot in the composition and you may find the image will maintain its current tonality but will have much better contrast and will stand more. It is a little "flat" as it is currently. In photography there is a constant battle between tonality that shows nice gradations from one tone to another and contrast which washes out tones. It is hard to find the happy medium.', '2006-03-15 09:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2229883, 306462, 32609, '<td valign="top">Love the texture. I would have drawn a little bit more of the 3 to be sure it can''t be mistaken for a 2.</td>', 'Love the texture. I would have drawn a little bit more of the 3 to be sure it can''t be mistaken for a 2.', '2006-03-15 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1);
