(2230053, 304941, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with great RGB colors and you captured a terrific expression. It is an appealing composition.<br/> <br/>I will join the chorus of others pointing out that the out-of-focus apple in the subject''s hand is a major distraction. Out-of-focus foreground generally does not work as well as out-of-focus background in most cases anyway but it is exceptionally distracting in this one because the apple is a major element in the composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition with great RGB colors and you captured a terrific expression. It is an appealing composition. I will join the chorus of others pointing out that the out-of-focus apple in the subject''s hand is a major distraction. Out-of-focus foreground generally does not work as well as out-of-focus background in most cases anyway but it is exceptionally distracting in this one because the apple is a major element in the composition.', '2006-03-15 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
