(2231748, 306554, 46336, '<td valign="top">Poor Pug. No trademark shots next week. Not much to say really. No major technical flaws; just a few compositional points. I dislike the corner line of the wall (although not sure what you could have doen about it). The colors are all similar so it lacks contrast and ''pop''.</td>', 'Poor Pug. No trademark shots next week. Not much to say really. No major technical flaws; just a few compositional points. I dislike the corner line of the wall (although not sure what you could have doen about it). The colors are all similar so it lacks contrast and ''pop''.', '2006-03-15 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231751, 306926, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very creative concept.  A little hot (overexposed) - this would have scored higher if it wasn''t.  5 from me for creativity, could have been an 8.  Hopefully I''m an anomaly.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative concept.  A little hot (overexposed) - this would have scored higher if it wasn''t.  5 from me for creativity, could have been an 8.  Hopefully I''m an anomaly.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-15 20:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231753, 306808, 42005, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  The light/white and clarity and positive message are grand.  Interesting way to make the white and the cover blend while her face and eyes are so extremely clear, which is what ''understanding through reading''  hopefully does.9</td>', 'What a great shot.  The light/white and clarity and positive message are grand.  Interesting way to make the white and the cover blend while her face and eyes are so extremely clear, which is what ''understanding through reading''  hopefully does.9', '2006-03-15 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
