(2231770, 305878, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like an intersting place to explore.  Almost could have gotten away with something a little closer in - a piece of the building (where is the question - so many cool places to try).  Depending on what the sign says over the door that may have been a good place to start with a portrait oriented image including the door, sign, and maybe some shadowed area.  As it is, it''s "OK".  Looks a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Looks like an intersting place to explore.  Almost could have gotten away with something a little closer in - a piece of the building (where is the question - so many cool places to try).  Depending on what the sign says over the door that may have been a good place to start with a portrait oriented image including the door, sign, and maybe some shadowed area.  As it is, it''s "OK".  Looks a little oversharpened.', '2006-03-15 20:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231796, 306513, 30049, '<td valign="top">Need some ink on that quill!  ;^)  Just giving you a hard time.  Interesting image.  Very nice approach for this challenge.  Good composition.  Not sure about the lighting - seems like it''s a little extreme at both ends (heavy shadows top left thru middle, hot spot on the bottom left).  Nit-picky I know.  FWIW, I do like it.  Good luck in the challenge.  7</td>', 'Need some ink on that quill!  ;^)  Just giving you a hard time.  Interesting image.  Very nice approach for this challenge.  Good composition.  Not sure about the lighting - seems like it''s a little extreme at both ends (heavy shadows top left thru middle, hot spot on the bottom left).  Nit-picky I know.  FWIW, I do like it.  Good luck in the challenge.  7', '2006-03-15 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
