(2232581, 304603, 53964, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones in the wood contrasting with the metal, but it''s rather noisy and the bits on the background are distracting, also the glare keeps drawing my eye back there when I''d rather look at the whole.</td>', 'I like the warm tones in the wood contrasting with the metal, but it''s rather noisy and the bits on the background are distracting, also the glare keeps drawing my eye back there when I''d rather look at the whole.', '2006-03-16 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2232587, 306762, 53964, '<td valign="top">IMO, a title should enhance the photo, not be necessary to explain it. <br/>Good contrast and detail on the cactus and I like the contrast between something we associate with heat and the snow, but the shade on the hill makes it look a little flat. It must have been a lovely spot :)</td>', 'IMO, a title should enhance the photo, not be necessary to explain it. Good contrast and detail on the cactus and I like the contrast between something we associate with heat and the snow, but the shade on the hill makes it look a little flat. It must have been a lovely spot :)', '2006-03-16 03:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2232589, 306441, 53964, '<td valign="top">He really looks asleep, unlike many of the posed "sleeping" subjects.<br/>Focus is off, though, and maybe some levels adjustment?</td>', 'He really looks asleep, unlike many of the posed "sleeping" subjects.Focus is off, though, and maybe some levels adjustment?', '2006-03-16 03:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
