(2233073, 306095, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the vanishing lines.  Good capture of the early morning mood.  Maybe a little closer to sunrise would have been even better.</td>', 'I like the vanishing lines.  Good capture of the early morning mood.  Maybe a little closer to sunrise would have been even better.', '2006-03-16 10:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
