(2233080, 306421, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait! Good composition, exposure and focus. But without the title there''s nothing about the picture that says "education" to me.</td>', 'Very nice portrait! Good composition, exposure and focus. But without the title there''s nothing about the picture that says "education" to me.', '2006-03-16 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
