(2233264, 305503, 35207, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, the tree in the background is important because it breaks up the sky.  would have been nice to have some color in the sky, but on the other hand the gray sky reminds me of feburary (cold) and ties other elements of the photo (coat, cold face).  overall i would have liked more color in the background or maybe tried the shot in b&amp;w to hide this.  7</td>', 'i like the idea, the tree in the background is important because it breaks up the sky.  would have been nice to have some color in the sky, but on the other hand the gray sky reminds me of feburary (cold) and ties other elements of the photo (coat, cold face).  overall i would have liked more color in the background or maybe tried the shot in b&w to hide this.  7', '2006-03-16 11:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233266, 306554, 35207, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.  original ideas are my favorite.  i think that there are other parts of the photo that i would have improved.  there isnt too much contrast in the picture (pug= blond; wall=yellow; floor=light brown)  maybe a red wall would have looked good but i understand not painting your house to take a picture.  the other aspect that i would have improved is that there is little depth to the picture.  every object in the photo is about the same distance from the camera.  im refrehed by the concept which is what makes it better than most of the photos in this challenge.  im soooooo tired of apples :P 7</td>', 'very nice shot.  original ideas are my favorite.  i think that there are other parts of the photo that i would have improved.  there isnt too much contrast in the picture (pug= blond; wall=yellow; floor=light brown)  maybe a red wall would have looked good but i understand not painting your house to take a picture.  the other aspect that i would have improved is that there is little depth to the picture.  every object in the photo is about the same distance from the camera.  im refrehed by the concept which is what makes it better than most of the photos in this challenge.  im soooooo tired of apples :P 7', '2006-03-16 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
