(2233310, 304923, 54610, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the lighting seems not quite right.  Maybe a second light?  Lighter clothes for more contrast?  Just suggestions.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the lighting seems not quite right.  Maybe a second light?  Lighter clothes for more contrast?  Just suggestions.', '2006-03-16 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233312, 305284, 35207, '<td valign="top">awesome photo.  there are many picture of books, apples, glasses and paper/pens.  for one to get a high score i think they really need to stand out and i think that this one does.  many of the others have no depth.  i dont think this one is original enough to be a top ten photo but it should easily be  a high scorer 8</td>', 'awesome photo.  there are many picture of books, apples, glasses and paper/pens.  for one to get a high score i think they really need to stand out and i think that this one does.  many of the others have no depth.  i dont think this one is original enough to be a top ten photo but it should easily be  a high scorer 8', '2006-03-16 11:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233315, 304513, 54610, '<td valign="top">I like your light placement.......too bad they don''t hold still at that age, eh?</td>', 'I like your light placement.......too bad they don''t hold still at that age, eh?', '2006-03-16 11:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233329, 306943, 54610, '<td valign="top">Catchy title.  Nice contrast.  Maybe shot at a different time of day though?  Lighting seems a little dull.</td>', 'Catchy title.  Nice contrast.  Maybe shot at a different time of day though?  Lighting seems a little dull.', '2006-03-16 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233331, 306697, 54610, '<td valign="top">Might have been better with the instructor in focus?</td>', 'Might have been better with the instructor in focus?', '2006-03-16 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233334, 306280, 54610, '<td valign="top">Something different....like your use of colors for contrast.  Your light angle is nice, too.</td>', 'Something different....like your use of colors for contrast.  Your light angle is nice, too.', '2006-03-16 11:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233391, 306808, 44172, '<td valign="top">she is precious, nice quality image with good coloring and lighting - your white background is perfect - something I cannot accomplish - good job :)</td>', 'she is precious, nice quality image with good coloring and lighting - your white background is perfect - something I cannot accomplish - good job :)', '2006-03-16 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233396, 306853, 44172, '<td valign="top">nice composition, my eye wants to wander out of the frame though - especially on the left with that window, the black and white seems a little bit flat - I''d have preferred to see a bit more in the black tones I think - nice idea though :)</td>', 'nice composition, my eye wants to wander out of the frame though - especially on the left with that window, the black and white seems a little bit flat - I''d have preferred to see a bit more in the black tones I think - nice idea though :)', '2006-03-16 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233400, 306444, 44172, '<td valign="top">like the sepia tone used - works well, nice quality - good job :)</td>', 'like the sepia tone used - works well, nice quality - good job :)', '2006-03-16 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233405, 305637, 44172, '<td valign="top">nice shot, sepia tone is nice, good perspective and border also, overall a pretty good idea and meets the challenge - good job :)</td>', 'nice shot, sepia tone is nice, good perspective and border also, overall a pretty good idea and meets the challenge - good job :)', '2006-03-16 12:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
