(2235328, 304602, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers. Cerebral meets psychodelic! Very cool. This is kind of like the classic types of wine glass, bottle type shots done with the chemistry flasks. Cool. Fits the challenge great, very creative. Great lighting. Nice composition. Nice reflections. Just a great idea and execution for this challenge. I quite like it. Nice job. :-)</td>', 'Wowsers. Cerebral meets psychodelic! Very cool. This is kind of like the classic types of wine glass, bottle type shots done with the chemistry flasks. Cool. Fits the challenge great, very creative. Great lighting. Nice composition. Nice reflections. Just a great idea and execution for this challenge. I quite like it. Nice job. :-)', '2006-03-17 05:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
