(2237344, 306510, 47852, '<td valign="top">The tilted composition doesn''t add anything to this shot for me, it makes it more difficult to find what I''m looking at instead.  I would have left this one horizontal as long as the cropping would have worked.</td>', 'The tilted composition doesn''t add anything to this shot for me, it makes it more difficult to find what I''m looking at instead.  I would have left this one horizontal as long as the cropping would have worked.', '2006-03-18 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
