(2237526, 304593, 46648, '<td valign="top">i really like the colors in this, i just wish the bag in the bottom left corner and the sign behind the second column weren''t there.  still, it''s a great photo.</td>', 'i really like the colors in this, i just wish the bag in the bottom left corner and the sign behind the second column weren''t there.  still, it''s a great photo.', '2006-03-18 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
