(2238696, 306414, 50674, '<td valign="top">Wormderful shot - my fave in this challenge. Good colours, I like the composition and it''s right on theme.</td>', 'Wormderful shot - my fave in this challenge. Good colours, I like the composition and it''s right on theme.', '2006-03-19 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
