(2238728, 304602, 45620, '<td valign="top">Great use of color - love the depth, the focus and the reflection! Just a very pretty shot!</td>', 'Great use of color - love the depth, the focus and the reflection! Just a very pretty shot!', '2006-03-19 08:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238730, 306933, 45620, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I really like the mountain view in the background and the cropping is good. The only problem is too much light. It washes out a lot of the detail in the picture and makes the lines less clear. Also a second sooner and you wouldn''t have to play hide and seek to see the kid getting on the bus.</td>', 'Good composition. I really like the mountain view in the background and the cropping is good. The only problem is too much light. It washes out a lot of the detail in the picture and makes the lines less clear. Also a second sooner and you wouldn''t have to play hide and seek to see the kid getting on the bus.', '2006-03-19 08:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238733, 306766, 45620, '<td valign="top">Keen lighing! - Great composition idea. A little weak in focus, but nice use of black and white. Very good depth and plenty to look at without any distractions. The only thing I don''t like is the title - she doesn''t look profane. High scores!</td>', 'Keen lighing! - Great composition idea. A little weak in focus, but nice use of black and white. Very good depth and plenty to look at without any distractions. The only thing I don''t like is the title - she doesn''t look profane. High scores!', '2006-03-19 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238736, 306400, 45620, '<td valign="top">Creative use of lighting - pulling her away from the wall would eliminate that unseemly shadow. Creative composition and good focus. Nice angle and good cropping!</td>', 'Creative use of lighting - pulling her away from the wall would eliminate that unseemly shadow. Creative composition and good focus. Nice angle and good cropping!', '2006-03-19 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238742, 306697, 45620, '<td valign="top">Strange title... hmmm, well the morion blur is a little too much, but kind of works with the sepia. Great cropping job - leaves you wanting to see more... and a really good composition idea!</td>', 'Strange title... hmmm, well the morion blur is a little too much, but kind of works with the sepia. Great cropping job - leaves you wanting to see more... and a really good composition idea!', '2006-03-19 08:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238744, 306616, 45620, '<td valign="top">Too much light on the book - and not much of a story told - your subject does not appear to be looking at the book or concentration on what she will write next... the focus is not sharp or clear on the subject either - but it was a good idea - keep it up</td>', 'Too much light on the book - and not much of a story told - your subject does not appear to be looking at the book or concentration on what she will write next... the focus is not sharp or clear on the subject either - but it was a good idea - keep it up', '2006-03-19 08:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238748, 306148, 45620, '<td valign="top">Good cropping. It is a little "foggy" looking - too much light maybe? Really great location for a shot and framed really well... just missing the WOW factor.</td>', 'Good cropping. It is a little "foggy" looking - too much light maybe? Really great location for a shot and framed really well... just missing the WOW factor.', '2006-03-19 08:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238751, 306569, 45620, '<td valign="top">You may want to crop in more on your subject - fill your frame and try a different angle. Just books all in a line, with flash washing out some of the titles, doesn''t do it. The idea is good, just the artwork is missing. Try different focal lengths and/or different angles and/or cropping.</td>', 'You may want to crop in more on your subject - fill your frame and try a different angle. Just books all in a line, with flash washing out some of the titles, doesn''t do it. The idea is good, just the artwork is missing. Try different focal lengths and/or different angles and/or cropping.', '2006-03-19 08:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238756, 306444, 45620, '<td valign="top">Great composition idea - love the colors - it looks cool! Most would have been tempted to black and white it - but keeping the gold tone makes it really enticing. I think that you could have improved this shot by cropping out the glare on the top of the book - it is distracting. Either a crop of a higher angle would have accomplished the same thing. Good job!</td>', 'Great composition idea - love the colors - it looks cool! Most would have been tempted to black and white it - but keeping the gold tone makes it really enticing. I think that you could have improved this shot by cropping out the glare on the top of the book - it is distracting. Either a crop of a higher angle would have accomplished the same thing. Good job!', '2006-03-19 08:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238759, 306700, 45620, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed makes this shot a little too grainy. Cool composition though - love the color difference from water to stone and the curve of the glass is really artsy! Either a longer exposure or a smaller f-stop number would make this shot a winner!</td>', 'A little underexposed makes this shot a little too grainy. Cool composition though - love the color difference from water to stone and the curve of the glass is really artsy! Either a longer exposure or a smaller f-stop number would make this shot a winner!', '2006-03-19 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238760, 306831, 45620, '<td valign="top">AWESOME depth - I pulled my face right up to the screen to try to see what was at the end of the hall! Great lines and really neat lighting effects! Probably a little cropped off the top would help kill that dead space up there, but a really great composition!</td>', 'AWESOME depth - I pulled my face right up to the screen to try to see what was at the end of the hall! Great lines and really neat lighting effects! Probably a little cropped off the top would help kill that dead space up there, but a really great composition!', '2006-03-19 09:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238761, 306417, 45620, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and angles - nice cropping - the focus leaves me thinking I have one contact out though - maybe a little more angle to really give it depth?</td>', 'Great use of color and angles - nice cropping - the focus leaves me thinking I have one contact out though - maybe a little more angle to really give it depth?', '2006-03-19 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238763, 306584, 45620, '<td valign="top">This compsition gives such an empty feeling. The black and white, coupled with one window teeming with life and one window filled with a factory - fits with your title. A melancholy person gazing out the window would have added a kick in the pants to this picture. I like the lighting and lines.. and the paper on the table becomes the subject... makes me wonder what it says...</td>', 'This compsition gives such an empty feeling. The black and white, coupled with one window teeming with life and one window filled with a factory - fits with your title. A melancholy person gazing out the window would have added a kick in the pants to this picture. I like the lighting and lines.. and the paper on the table becomes the subject... makes me wonder what it says...', '2006-03-19 09:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238767, 306761, 45620, '<td valign="top">too much grain (underexposed), and too little focus (the wood is in focus instead of the subjects) - a good composition idea and a nice attempt at use of angles. I think adding some light from somewhere off to the side would have realy added to this picture. even a flashlight would have worked.</td>', 'too much grain (underexposed), and too little focus (the wood is in focus instead of the subjects) - a good composition idea and a nice attempt at use of angles. I think adding some light from somewhere off to the side would have realy added to this picture. even a flashlight would have worked.', '2006-03-19 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238772, 306755, 45620, '<td valign="top">Really good composition idea! The shirt actually detracts from the picture though - the "blast off" is so bright that it takes your focus from the subject matter. The hat is appropriate due to the awful weather outside, and the use of ambient lighing was a great idea. I like the pose and use of the backpack as a prop. The wood is beautiful and the window view is appropriate. You could have cropped out the top of the picture - since it is just dead space to keep the focal point on your subject.</td>', 'Really good composition idea! The shirt actually detracts from the picture though - the "blast off" is so bright that it takes your focus from the subject matter. The hat is appropriate due to the awful weather outside, and the use of ambient lighing was a great idea. I like the pose and use of the backpack as a prop. The wood is beautiful and the window view is appropriate. You could have cropped out the top of the picture - since it is just dead space to keep the focal point on your subject.', '2006-03-19 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238774, 306624, 45620, '<td valign="top">oh yeah! color, texture, depth and expression - this is an emotion charged shot. The weather beaten hand is the focal point of the picture and is is sharp focus. the stream of tea? is fluid in motion - the only suggestion is to cut out the top half inch - it is just dead wasted space.</td>', 'oh yeah! color, texture, depth and expression - this is an emotion charged shot. The weather beaten hand is the focal point of the picture and is is sharp focus. the stream of tea? is fluid in motion - the only suggestion is to cut out the top half inch - it is just dead wasted space.', '2006-03-19 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238777, 306836, 45620, '<td valign="top">Cute title and great composition idea- the nose being in focus adds texture but the tie is a little off topic. I think that by focusing on the eyes this would have made the shot more appealing.</td>', 'Cute title and great composition idea- the nose being in focus adds texture but the tie is a little off topic. I think that by focusing on the eyes this would have made the shot more appealing.', '2006-03-19 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238779, 306775, 45620, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! It is so difficult to get motion shots in focus and to avoid the evident motion blur that is here. My suggestion is that if you are going to have motion - use a larger fstop - smaller number - and go ahead and get the sharper details so that the motion blur becomes part of your art. You could also crop the bottom portion of this shot - it is just dead space that is not adding, but detracting from the focal point of your photograph.</td>', 'Cool shot! It is so difficult to get motion shots in focus and to avoid the evident motion blur that is here. My suggestion is that if you are going to have motion - use a larger fstop - smaller number - and go ahead and get the sharper details so that the motion blur becomes part of your art. You could also crop the bottom portion of this shot - it is just dead space that is not adding, but detracting from the focal point of your photograph.', '2006-03-19 09:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238780, 306779, 45620, '<td valign="top">This would be a much better shot with good focus. Try using a tripod with a longer shutter speed.</td>', 'This would be a much better shot with good focus. Try using a tripod with a longer shutter speed.', '2006-03-19 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238782, 306938, 45620, '<td valign="top">Very very cool! great composition - so far my favorite!!! I love her pose, the background and her expression!!! The use of black adn white only adds to the apprehension, and her eyes are perfect! Good texture, lighting, cropping, and idea! KUDOS!!!</td>', 'Very very cool! great composition - so far my favorite!!! I love her pose, the background and her expression!!! The use of black adn white only adds to the apprehension, and her eyes are perfect! Good texture, lighting, cropping, and idea! KUDOS!!!', '2006-03-19 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238783, 304580, 45620, '<td valign="top">Really great idea! I love this composition idea - it is amazing. The lighting coming in on an angle was a great idea too - but it is not quite right. The background texture is a little distracting to me as well. BUT, it is the best idea I have seen yet - great story!</td>', 'Really great idea! I love this composition idea - it is amazing. The lighting coming in on an angle was a great idea too - but it is not quite right. The background texture is a little distracting to me as well. BUT, it is the best idea I have seen yet - great story!', '2006-03-19 09:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238784, 306554, 45620, '<td valign="top">Cute composition - I like the colors, and there are no distractions in the background. The problem is the focus - the dog is not in it - and as the subject - that really matters! You also have a shadow showing and that is distracting - when you have this good of an idea you need to not let anything in your picture detract from it.</td>', 'Cute composition - I like the colors, and there are no distractions in the background. The problem is the focus - the dog is not in it - and as the subject - that really matters! You also have a shadow showing and that is distracting - when you have this good of an idea you need to not let anything in your picture detract from it.', '2006-03-19 09:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238786, 306513, 45620, '<td valign="top">ooooooh! I love it - such details, such texture - great lighting and absolutely artsy! Of course, the lack of a tip on that feather is a little disjointed, but this is a GREAT shot! very very fun to look at again and again</td>', 'ooooooh! I love it - such details, such texture - great lighting and absolutely artsy! Of course, the lack of a tip on that feather is a little disjointed, but this is a GREAT shot! very very fun to look at again and again', '2006-03-19 09:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238789, 306132, 45620, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why the parking sign is so prominent in this shot - parking at jail? Also the water softens and makes this place more attractive, instead of fearsome... maybe black and white to take away all color and life from this shot would have had more of an impact, and a tighter crop on so that there is no down time trying to figure out what this shot is of.</td>', 'I am not sure why the parking sign is so prominent in this shot - parking at jail? Also the water softens and makes this place more attractive, instead of fearsome... maybe black and white to take away all color and life from this shot would have had more of an impact, and a tighter crop on so that there is no down time trying to figure out what this shot is of.', '2006-03-19 09:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238790, 306699, 45620, '<td valign="top">I am assuming you used a filter because of the strange focus on this shot, but I could be wrong. Basically it is a great idea, but with so much dead space in the photo it is hard to keep ones interest - I believe that cropping in on the focal point would be really helpful. The spirals add great texture, and the handwriting has a story all of its own. Maybe try putting the camera right down on the page?</td>', 'I am assuming you used a filter because of the strange focus on this shot, but I could be wrong. Basically it is a great idea, but with so much dead space in the photo it is hard to keep ones interest - I believe that cropping in on the focal point would be really helpful. The spirals add great texture, and the handwriting has a story all of its own. Maybe try putting the camera right down on the page?', '2006-03-19 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238791, 306708, 45620, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and grainy - try a tripod and autofocus? It is a good idea - but the distractions are too much</td>', 'Too blurry and grainy - try a tripod and autofocus? It is a good idea - but the distractions are too much', '2006-03-19 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238794, 304549, 45620, '<td valign="top">smashed shoes?  - maybe try getting wet footprints to leave behind - and crop out the wet pavement above to cut down on distraction? The black absorbs too much light and doesn''t leave much detail.</td>', 'smashed shoes?  - maybe try getting wet footprints to leave behind - and crop out the wet pavement above to cut down on distraction? The black absorbs too much light and doesn''t leave much detail.', '2006-03-19 09:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238857, 306444, 32133, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I love the reflective surface and the coloring.</td>', 'Love it.  I love the reflective surface and the coloring.', '2006-03-19 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
