(2239119, 304967, 53754, '<td valign="top">Very representative of today''s learning environment. Good job.</td>', 'Very representative of today''s learning environment. Good job.', '2006-03-19 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239279, 306826, 30896, '<td valign="top">i kinda share the feeling (esp. since i recently started to teach at a univesity here :-) and at first look i liked the composition  and your choice of colors. but after second look i wander why the letters next to the pen are printed and not handwritten, why the line beneath them gets thin... it make is too artificial, not a remark someone would write in school when bored...</td>', 'i kinda share the feeling (esp. since i recently started to teach at a univesity here :-) and at first look i liked the composition  and your choice of colors. but after second look i wander why the letters next to the pen are printed and not handwritten, why the line beneath them gets thin... it make is too artificial, not a remark someone would write in school when bored...', '2006-03-19 15:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239331, 306421, 30896, '<td valign="top">great use of b/w and intriguing portrait but to be honest, it doesn''t convey any "education" feel to me</td>', 'great use of b/w and intriguing portrait but to be honest, it doesn''t convey any "education" feel to me', '2006-03-19 16:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239453, 304603, 54226, '<td valign="top">Great catch of the eye, with balance, shadows, and wonder!</td>', 'Great catch of the eye, with balance, shadows, and wonder!', '2006-03-19 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239471, 306762, 54226, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, foreground and background balance.  Good eye!</td>', 'Nice framing, foreground and background balance.  Good eye!', '2006-03-19 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239478, 306447, 54226, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field and focal length.  I like the title!</td>', 'Good use of depth of field and focal length.  I like the title!', '2006-03-19 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239489, 304925, 54226, '<td valign="top">The B/W effect really adds to the starkness!</td>', 'The B/W effect really adds to the starkness!', '2006-03-19 17:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239498, 306685, 45620, '<td valign="top">Cute! I love the texture and color - the cropping is perfect! absolutely beautiful lighting and very keen focal point. Absolutely no distractions - great job!!!</td>', 'Cute! I love the texture and color - the cropping is perfect! absolutely beautiful lighting and very keen focal point. Absolutely no distractions - great job!!!', '2006-03-19 17:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239505, 306708, 54226, '<td valign="top">I think the focusing might have made this one better.</td>', 'I think the focusing might have made this one better.', '2006-03-19 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239510, 305858, 53754, '<td valign="top">Love the symbolism.</td>', 'Love the symbolism.', '2006-03-19 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239514, 306269, 45620, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a composition - the lighting is a little off and although true to life there is too much chaos. You might have cropped in to take out the paisley couch and tried indirect lighting - bounced of the walls or ceiling instead of direct flash - that would have added some depth and texture to the shot.</td>', 'Good idea for a composition - the lighting is a little off and although true to life there is too much chaos. You might have cropped in to take out the paisley couch and tried indirect lighting - bounced of the walls or ceiling instead of direct flash - that would have added some depth and texture to the shot.', '2006-03-19 17:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239519, 305276, 45620, '<td valign="top">Cute! I love this composition idea! Great use of focus, good lighting - a light coming in from the side would have dressed this shot up, nice angle on the book too! Keep it up!</td>', 'Cute! I love this composition idea! Great use of focus, good lighting - a light coming in from the side would have dressed this shot up, nice angle on the book too! Keep it up!', '2006-03-19 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239523, 304751, 54226, '<td valign="top">Neat effect and placement!</td>', 'Neat effect and placement!', '2006-03-19 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239530, 305679, 54226, '<td valign="top">Great title for capturing a look into history!</td>', 'Great title for capturing a look into history!', '2006-03-19 17:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239532, 304580, 54226, '<td valign="top">Hmm, interesting idea and setup!</td>', 'Hmm, interesting idea and setup!', '2006-03-19 17:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239533, 306926, 45620, '<td valign="top">This is a really creative idea for a composition! The color is nice, but the flash washout on the pencils'' erasers is a little bit of a distraction. Other than that this is a great shot! Nice texture - good focus and cropping!</td>', 'This is a really creative idea for a composition! The color is nice, but the flash washout on the pencils'' erasers is a little bit of a distraction. Other than that this is a great shot! Nice texture - good focus and cropping!', '2006-03-19 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239539, 306699, 54226, '<td valign="top">Definitely depicts what can be an abruptness of depth of field!</td>', 'Definitely depicts what can be an abruptness of depth of field!', '2006-03-19 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239541, 306697, 54226, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone effect, and the capture of the professor as a quick moving blur, the effect of speaking quickly as everyone else soaks it in!  Great shot!</td>', 'I like the sepia tone effect, and the capture of the professor as a quick moving blur, the effect of speaking quickly as everyone else soaks it in!  Great shot!', '2006-03-19 17:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239542, 306849, 54226, '<td valign="top">I like the dimensional angles, and foreground/background placement.</td>', 'I like the dimensional angles, and foreground/background placement.', '2006-03-19 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239548, 306543, 54226, '<td valign="top">Good effect with light and setting!</td>', 'Good effect with light and setting!', '2006-03-19 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239550, 306439, 45620, '<td valign="top">The photo is just missing the WOW factor. It is a good composition idea - very appropriate title - good lay out for the picture even - but the guy is trying too hard to keep his eyes closed -- so it appears staged instead of believable. And the lighting is awesome, but because it is an "all-nighter" he would generally have a lamp for light - but it is missing. All in all this is a pretty shot  good scores here!</td>', 'The photo is just missing the WOW factor. It is a good composition idea - very appropriate title - good lay out for the picture even - but the guy is trying too hard to keep his eyes closed -- so it appears staged instead of believable. And the lighting is awesome, but because it is an "all-nighter" he would generally have a lamp for light - but it is missing. All in all this is a pretty shot  good scores here!', '2006-03-19 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239551, 306513, 54226, '<td valign="top">Hmm, does catch the eye!</td>', 'Hmm, does catch the eye!', '2006-03-19 17:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239552, 306146, 45620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ighting and focus!!! Love the depth - and the window, chair and wall have unique textures. I think a little tighter crop is my only suggestion - good job</td>', 'Beautiful ighting and focus!!! Love the depth - and the window, chair and wall have unique textures. I think a little tighter crop is my only suggestion - good job', '2006-03-19 17:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239557, 306713, 45620, '<td valign="top">The focus is not true in this shot - and the shadow is really distracting. Try a tripod with a longer shutter speed. Nice angle usage - just little things that mean a lot.</td>', 'The focus is not true in this shot - and the shadow is really distracting. Try a tripod with a longer shutter speed. Nice angle usage - just little things that mean a lot.', '2006-03-19 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239558, 306205, 54226, '<td valign="top">Simple but elegant composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Simple but elegant composition.  Well done!', '2006-03-19 17:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239564, 306849, 45620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great color, Great focus, Great textures, Lovely setting, even depth! I think if the building had been closer to the fence this would be a winner!</td>', 'Beautiful! Great color, Great focus, Great textures, Lovely setting, even depth! I think if the building had been closer to the fence this would be a winner!', '2006-03-19 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239568, 305148, 54226, '<td valign="top">Great capture of colors and form!</td>', 'Great capture of colors and form!', '2006-03-19 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
