(2242068, 306477, 12962, '<td valign="top">It''s my desk!!! Love it!  It really illustrates a harried teacher''s work environment.  Like I said, it''s my desk.  Colors are great, btw. 8.</td>', 'It''s my desk!!! Love it!  It really illustrates a harried teacher''s work environment.  Like I said, it''s my desk.  Colors are great, btw. 8.', '2006-03-20 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
