(2242144, 305114, 12962, '<td valign="top">High impact.  Nice eye you''ve captured.</td>', 'High impact.  Nice eye you''ve captured.', '2006-03-20 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242146, 306488, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute scene and the composition seems just right to me. If only it were sharper. I can see that it was shot at a slow shutter speed and probably handheld. A tripod can hold the camera steady and prevent blur from camera shake (I use one that can get very low to the ground for shooting children). Bumping up the ISO setting, when possible, can help acheive a faster shutter speed and reduce the motion blur from the subject.</td>', 'This is a really cute scene and the composition seems just right to me. If only it were sharper. I can see that it was shot at a slow shutter speed and probably handheld. A tripod can hold the camera steady and prevent blur from camera shake (I use one that can get very low to the ground for shooting children). Bumping up the ISO setting, when possible, can help acheive a faster shutter speed and reduce the motion blur from the subject.', '2006-03-20 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242150, 306757, 12962, '<td valign="top">Tugs the heart. So many interpretations.  Love the curious eyes. 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-22 10:41:21.</i></td>', 'Tugs the heart. So many interpretations.  Love the curious eyes. 10.', '2006-03-20 16:12:21.000000', '2006-03-22 10:41:21.000000', 1),
