(2242301, 306697, 30049, '<td valign="top">What''s up with all the hats on in the classroom?!  It''s funny how I noticed them.  This image seems to have a natural leading line that draws your eye right into that back left corner.  Looks like some tough lighting here with natural light coming from your back right (blows out the white paper some), then you have the overhead lighting in the room.  At least no one is sleeping.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What''s up with all the hats on in the classroom?!  It''s funny how I noticed them.  This image seems to have a natural leading line that draws your eye right into that back left corner.  Looks like some tough lighting here with natural light coming from your back right (blows out the white paper some), then you have the overhead lighting in the room.  At least no one is sleeping.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-20 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
