(2242810, 305508, 45620, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty photograph. The green is a welcome change from the scenery around here! (smile) Nice lighting, focus and subject. Pretty straightforward shot.</td>', 'This is a pretty photograph. The green is a welcome change from the scenery around here! (smile) Nice lighting, focus and subject. Pretty straightforward shot.', '2006-03-20 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
