(2242817, 306246, 45620, '<td valign="top">The blur is so distracting in this shot. The focus and the motion blur combine for something that almost is painful to look at. We used to joke about learning through osmosis - this composition idea was a really good one. You used good cropping and color - maybe a tripod would help?</td>', 'The blur is so distracting in this shot. The focus and the motion blur combine for something that almost is painful to look at. We used to joke about learning through osmosis - this composition idea was a really good one. You used good cropping and color - maybe a tripod would help?', '2006-03-20 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242831, 306447, 45620, '<td valign="top">I love this composition! The lighting is beautiful and golden, the depth is wonderful. The lines are great at keeping your eyes on the picture. The depth of field is ideal and the only thing I can think of as an improvement is if the field led directly into the bluer portion of the sky - GREAT JOB!!!</td>', 'I love this composition! The lighting is beautiful and golden, the depth is wonderful. The lines are great at keeping your eyes on the picture. The depth of field is ideal and the only thing I can think of as an improvement is if the field led directly into the bluer portion of the sky - GREAT JOB!!!', '2006-03-20 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242837, 306950, 45620, '<td valign="top">Too much grain - the brick wall is cool and the candlelight is pretty - maybe if you used a tripod and a longer shutter speed you could capture this shot without any graininess - or maybe you did it on purpose - who knows?</td>', 'Too much grain - the brick wall is cool and the candlelight is pretty - maybe if you used a tripod and a longer shutter speed you could capture this shot without any graininess - or maybe you did it on purpose - who knows?', '2006-03-20 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
