(2243003, 306217, 1759, '<td valign="top">I love their expressions and the sense of action. The B&amp;W conversion is very good, to my eye, much better than the typical.</td>', 'I love their expressions and the sense of action. The B&W conversion is very good, to my eye, much better than the typical.', '2006-03-20 22:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243011, 305588, 1759, '<td valign="top">Tough dealing with bright sun on snow. You managed to get the exposure about right. Is there perhaps a better time of day for the position of the sun given this perspective?</td>', 'Tough dealing with bright sun on snow. You managed to get the exposure about right. Is there perhaps a better time of day for the position of the sun given this perspective?', '2006-03-20 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243015, 305617, 1759, '<td valign="top">Too bad they are so dirty (yeah I know, winter weather). The yellow would make a bright color study if they had just been washed :-)</td>', 'Too bad they are so dirty (yeah I know, winter weather). The yellow would make a bright color study if they had just been washed :-)', '2006-03-20 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243024, 306570, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good capture and nice composition. The highlights do look a bit blown out to me (something we didn''t have to worry about as much with B&amp;W film). I like the contrast and tone as they lend to a sense of antiquity.</td>', 'Good capture and nice composition. The highlights do look a bit blown out to me (something we didn''t have to worry about as much with B&W film). I like the contrast and tone as they lend to a sense of antiquity.', '2006-03-20 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243047, 306865, 1759, '<td valign="top">Some things never change. This reminds me of my a picture I have in a box from a very long time ago, the classic school photo.</td>', 'Some things never change. This reminds me of my a picture I have in a box from a very long time ago, the classic school photo.', '2006-03-20 23:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243052, 306936, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge.', '2006-03-20 23:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243057, 306943, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very pixelated (it''s an extremely small file - don''t compress so much).  Composition of the image is too busy - what''s the subject, where should I look, what''s the focal point?  It appears to be an overcast day, but the image is still dark and under-exposed.  Hope I''m not being too blunt.  I wish you the best of luck. ;^)</td>', 'Very pixelated (it''s an extremely small file - don''t compress so much).  Composition of the image is too busy - what''s the subject, where should I look, what''s the focal point?  It appears to be an overcast day, but the image is still dark and under-exposed.  Hope I''m not being too blunt.  I wish you the best of luck. ;^)', '2006-03-20 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243176, 306461, 48298, '<td valign="top">Should ribbon.  Beautiful architecture, tone and composition.</td>', 'Should ribbon.  Beautiful architecture, tone and composition.', '2006-03-21 00:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243369, 304925, 46528, '<td valign="top">wow! I can''t get over the symmetry of this one!! gorgeous!bumpin!</td>', 'wow! I can''t get over the symmetry of this one!! gorgeous!bumpin!', '2006-03-21 02:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243370, 306462, 46528, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant...7</td>', 'simple and elegant...7', '2006-03-21 02:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243449, 304941, 52472, '<td valign="top">Unfocused foregrounds often catch the eye in a disturbing way, like here IMHO.</td>', 'Unfocused foregrounds often catch the eye in a disturbing way, like here IMHO.', '2006-03-21 04:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243757, 304616, 54844, '<td valign="top">This one does it for me. I love it</td>', 'This one does it for me. I love it', '2006-03-21 08:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243850, 306826, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems like a bit of a disconnect with the type on the page versus an ink pen.  Why not write the words out instead of sticking a piece of paper on the notepad?  The message is funny.  Lighting is a little harsh (a softbox or light tent would help some with this).<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)</td>', 'Seems like a bit of a disconnect with the type on the page versus an ink pen.  Why not write the words out instead of sticking a piece of paper on the notepad?  The message is funny.  Lighting is a little harsh (a softbox or light tent would help some with this). Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)', '2006-03-21 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243857, 304602, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...  A refreshing take on the challenge.  Thank you!  ;^)  Well done.  Fun color, good subject (beakers), nice lighting and reflections.  I do wish the DOF was a little deeper to put the front beaker in focus.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh...  A refreshing take on the challenge.  Thank you!  ;^)  Well done.  Fun color, good subject (beakers), nice lighting and reflections.  I do wish the DOF was a little deeper to put the front beaker in focus.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-21 09:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243960, 306842, 30049, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  That''s some serious blue.  WB off, or did you push the saturation too much?  Cool perspective of the bus.  Makes it look 100 feet long!  ;^)</td>', 'Woohoo!  That''s some serious blue.  WB off, or did you push the saturation too much?  Cool perspective of the bus.  Makes it look 100 feet long!  ;^)', '2006-03-21 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243972, 306766, 30049, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look THAT upset.  Looks more like a note to a friend or something she''s working on.  ;^)  The B/W treatment works well for this image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'She doesn''t look THAT upset.  Looks more like a note to a friend or something she''s working on.  ;^)  The B/W treatment works well for this image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-21 10:10:23.000000', NULL, 1);
