(2245078, 306570, 27901, '<td valign="top">Hmmm and I thought Luxembourg didn''t have an university... to learn that is educative;-) Great shot but would have been better if it was more clear and not overexposed partly.</td>', 'Hmmm and I thought Luxembourg didn''t have an university... to learn that is educative;-) Great shot but would have been better if it was more clear and not overexposed partly.', '2006-03-21 18:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
