(2245088, 306477, 27901, '<td valign="top">This mess is certainly like school stuff. This is a very good idea but there is something lacking to rest your eye on, I keep wondering around the picture. The title on the box is good but it is centered to much isn''t it??? But then sorry it is just my humble opinion I am not all that clever in this.</td>', 'This mess is certainly like school stuff. This is a very good idea but there is something lacking to rest your eye on, I keep wondering around the picture. The title on the box is good but it is centered to much isn''t it??? But then sorry it is just my humble opinion I am not all that clever in this.', '2006-03-21 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
