(2245101, 306584, 27901, '<td valign="top">Interesting view... I am thinking about the cropping, weather not to have it so narrow or to make it closer and just to the bridge on the left. The chimney to the right grabs my attention all the time. I think that the paper on the table or the people on the bridge should be those grabbing attention more. But I love your iidea and certainly encourage you to do this shot again and finetune it a bit.</td>', 'Interesting view... I am thinking about the cropping, weather not to have it so narrow or to make it closer and just to the bridge on the left. The chimney to the right grabs my attention all the time. I think that the paper on the table or the people on the bridge should be those grabbing attention more. But I love your iidea and certainly encourage you to do this shot again and finetune it a bit.', '2006-03-21 18:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2245105, 304616, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great clear shot, you expect the people to move all of a sudden! Well done!</td>', 'Great clear shot, you expect the people to move all of a sudden! Well done!', '2006-03-21 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
