(2246171, 306281, 19708, '<td valign="top">monitor calibration is critical to see that there is detail in the top of the bell tower. Looking at your monitor at an extreme angle will show it if it''s not visible.<br/>Snow does this btw.</td>', 'monitor calibration is critical to see that there is detail in the top of the bell tower. Looking at your monitor at an extreme angle will show it if it''s not visible.Snow does this btw.', '2006-03-22 01:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
